<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") %>

<style>
  .privacy-container {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 2rem auto;
  }
  .privacy-container h2 {
    color: #007bff;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .privacy-container pre {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 0.7rem;
    padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.6;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }
</style>


<div class="privacy-container mt-5">
  <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
  <pre>
    <!-- Add your privacy policy content here -->
    Last Updated: 08/07/2025

    We value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our website.

    1. Information We Collect
    Personal Information: When you register, contact us, or make a listing, we may collect your name, email address, and other details.

    Listing Data: Details you add to your listings (title, images, location) are stored for display purposes.

    Usage Data: We collect analytics data like IP address, browser type, and pages visited to improve user experience.

    2. How We Use Your Information
    To provide and improve our services.

    To personalize your experience.

    To communicate updates, offers, or alerts (if opted-in).

    To prevent fraudulent or malicious activities.

    3. Cookies
    Our site uses cookies to enhance functionality and remember preferences. You can control cookie preferences in your browser settings.

    4. Data Sharing
    We do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties. Your data may only be shared with service providers who help operate our platform (e.g., hosting providers), and only to the extent necessary.

    5. Your Rights
    You have the right to:

    Access your personal data.

    Request correction or deletion.

    Withdraw consent or request data export.

    To do so, please contact us at homigoofficial@gmail.com.

    6. Security
    We implement industry-standard security measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.

    7. Updates
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any major changes will be notified on the site.
  </pre>
</div>